config HEXAGON_HVX
	tristate "Hexagon HVX Module"
	help
	  Modular support for Hexagon HVX coprocessor context management.
	  HVX (Hexagon Vector eXtensions) provides SIMD vector processing
	  with 128-byte vector registers.  This module handles per-thread
	  context save/restore, lazy allocation on coprocessor fault, and
	  hardware configuration via the H2 hypervisor HWCONFIG interface.
